Deliver issue {{issue}} for {{repository}}: provenance-bound peer evidence and quorum workflow gates.

Issue URL: {{issueUrl}}
Project board: {{projectBoard}}

You are the sole code writer. Ask provenance-grok and provenance-gemini independently for research, plans, and final review through pi-mesh. Bind every claimed peer result to its durable message ID in the run record. Record plans, decisions, contradictions, errors, and lessons under .kxm. Keep the issue and project board current. The user authorizes branch-local implementation, tests, documentation, commits, pushes, pull requests, CI monitoring, and merge only after all required checks and independent review pass. Preserve backward compatibility and never claim exactly-once execution.
